          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " science.",
          "start": 861.16,
          "end": 861.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But when you put anything in pure oxygen and light a match, everything would be combusted. Everything.",
