        },
        {
          "word": " astronauts.",
          "start": 895.14,
          "end": 895.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why God didn't give us 100% oxygen.",
      "start": 897.12,
      "end": 900.38,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
