          "end": 2488.59,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " still...",
          "start": 2488.59,
          "end": 2488.69,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It didn't say \"take your only legitimate son.\" It said \"take your only son,\" even if he's illegitimate.\"",
