        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Genesis 22, around 25, it says \"when Abraham died, his two sons, Ishmael and Isaac, buried him.\"",
      "start": 2626.61,
      "end": 2633.01,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " In",
          "start": 2626.61,
          "end": 2626.71,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Genesis",
          "start": 2626.71,
          "end": 2626.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
