          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " warning.",
          "start": 2783.75,
          "end": 2785.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They carry the revelations, the knowledge, and they also carry out commands from God.",
