          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " Armenia.",
          "start": 2797.39,
          "end": 2797.95,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the devastating earthquake, they had a lot of people on the news conjecturing.",
